sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Application Code
    participant TM as Transaction Manager / DB Engine
    participant WAL as Write-Ahead Log (WAL / Redo Log)
    participant Buffer as Buffer Pool (In-Memory Pages)
    participant Disk as Data Files (Disk)

    App->>TM: BEGIN TRANSACTION (Tx 901)
    App->>TM: UPDATE accounts SET balance = balance - 100 WHERE id = 1
    TM->>Buffer: Pin Page & Apply Delta (Dirty Page)
    TM->>WAL: Append Log Record (Tx 901: Account 1 -100)
    App->>TM: UPDATE accounts SET balance = balance + 100 WHERE id = 2
    TM->>Buffer: Pin Page & Apply Delta (Dirty Page)
    TM->>WAL: Append Log Record (Tx 901: Account 2 +100)
    
    alt Commit Transaction
        App->>TM: COMMIT
        TM->>WAL: Flush Log Record to Disk (fsync WAL - Durability Guaranteed)
        TM-->>App: Commit Successful (200 OK)
        Note over Buffer,Disk: Background checkpoint asynchronously flushes dirty pages to Disk
    else Rollback / Error
        App->>TM: ROLLBACK
        TM->>Buffer: Revert in-memory dirty changes using Undo Log
        TM-->>App: Abort Successful (Atomicity Guaranteed)
    end
